: help
:
$* --help >>~/EOO/
  SYNOPSIS

  companion --help
  companion --version
  companion --steam [-- <steam-arg>...]

  DESCRIPTION
  /.*/*
  EOO

: version
:
$* --version >>~/EOO/
  /companion \S+/
  /libcompanion \S+/
  Copyright (c) the IW4x authors.
  This is free software released under the GNU General Public License, version 3, with the IW4x Linking Exception, version 1.1.
  EOO

: no-operation
:
: Test a command line without --steam.
:
$* 2>>EOE != 0
  error: nothing to do
    info: specify --steam
    info: run 'companion --help' for more information
  EOE

: unknown-option
:
$* --frobnicate 2>>EOE != 0
  error: unknown option '--frobnicate'
    info: run 'companion --help' for more information
  EOE

: unknown-argument
:
: Test an argument before --, where we take none.
:
$* --steam foo 2>>EOE != 0
  error: unknown argument 'foo'
    info: run 'companion --help' for more information
  EOE

: steam-arguments
:
: Test the Steam arguments without --steam.
:
$* -- -silent 2>>EOE != 0
  error: Steam arguments specified without --steam
    info: run 'companion --help' for more information
  EOE

: steam-option-argument
:
: Test that our options after -- are Steam arguments.
:
$* -- --steam 2>>EOE != 0
  error: Steam arguments specified without --steam
    info: run 'companion --help' for more information
  EOE
